<title>USA: Playboy names Havard as financial chief.</title>
<headline>Playboy names Havard as financial chief.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Playboy Enterprises Inc said Monday it named Linda Havard as chief financial officer and executive vice president of finance and operations, effective May 16.</p>
<p>Havard most recently served as senior vice president of Atlantic Richfield Co's ARCO Global Energy Ventures division.  </p>
<p>Havard replaces David Chemerow, who left Playboy last year, the company said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
